{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"text\": \"行动曾让他摆脱犹豫，向往的日子也曾让他安稳，可如今单靠哪边都定不下下一步。\",\n      \"key\": \"定不下下一步\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他没力气立刻想出办法，只想往前时还记得为何不肯再等，想守着那种日子时也别忘了威胁它的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"不肯再等\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他还想往前，也舍不得那种日子，便没那么急着逼自己马上丢掉其中一边。\",\n      \"key\": \"丢掉其中一边\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R45\", \"R46\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S10-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留看清愿望仍不能直接带来勇气，以及行动和旧愿都曾帮过他、此刻却都不足以指明下一步。用S04-1说明行动曾带来的力量，用S06-7说明旧愿带来的真实安宁，再用S07-5、S07-3交代两边各自的限度。S06-7只解释旧愿曾带来安稳，不再解释未解决的问题为何重新浮现。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R47\", \"R48\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S10-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"补回继续争取时记得当初为何不肯再等、想守着安宁时也别忘了威胁它的事。保留他暂时想不出办法的无力感，删去反复想着愿望这一没有增加新心理事实的环节。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R49\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S10-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把二选一的压力松动接到他仍想往前、又舍不得那种日子的同时心愿上，让变化有具体前因。删除S04-1到这一条的箭头，因为行动曾让他走出犹豫，并不能解释他为何开始放松对自己的二选一要求。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B4\",\n      \"why\": \"这是把回返听成疲倦地回想往事的另一种理解。前面没有足够经历支撑具体的往事或讲述对象，不把珠子的比喻写成他真实的回忆。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b550cfc2-ecb9-4a42-9e96-aff7f161c50e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T095458506109Z", "elapsed_seconds": 578.703, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T10:04:37.224900+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1b785be3c6b2fced642436355213d2518d06085bb4fa45e2cc7b54228a866c30", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T095458506109Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "88613fa921c5abead98b674d328539e2aa8a3094b62873ed77f616dd5b20d14b"}}}
